       <p>We will collect necessary personal information, including your name, email address, shipping address, mobile number, and other essential details. This information can be used for promotional activities by Blue Star and will be shared with our third-party logistic partners, which is essential for fulfilling your order. We will collect and process the information in accordance with our <a target="_blank" href="/pages/privacy-policy"><u>Privacy policy</u>.</a></p>
