 to":"Send transcript to","Email transcript":"Email transcript","Transcript sent to email":"Transcript sent to email","Send":"Send","View similar":"View similar","Manual pick for you":"Manual pick for you","Ask about it":"Ask about it","I want to know more about":"I want to know more about","Checkout our best seller!":"Checkout our best seller!","Checkout our new arrivals!":"Checkout our new arrivals!","Top picks for you":"Top picks for you","Analyzing query":"Analyzing query","Looking up information":"Looking up information","Preparing results":"Preparing results","Almost ready":"Almost ready","Searching for products":"Searching for products","Getting product details":"Getting product details","Finding available discounts":"Finding available discounts","Checking size guide":"Checking size guide","Checking loyalty program":"Checking loyalty program","Tracking your order":"Tracking your order","Processing support request":"Processing support request","Connecting to human agent":"Connecting to human agent","Retrieving your cart":"Retrieving your cart","Adding to cart":"Adding to cart","Updating cart":"Updating cart","Shopping bag":"Shopping bag","Your cart":"Your cart","Your cart is empty":"Your cart is empty","Chat with AI to discover products you'll love!":"Chat with AI to discover products you'll love!","Start shopping":"Start shopping","Subtotal":"Subtotal","item":"item","Checkout":"Checkout","Some items in your cart are no longer available":"Some items in your cart are no longer available","Remove from cart?":"Remove from cart?","{{title}} will be removed from your cart.":"{{title}} will be removed from your cart.","Keep item":"Keep item","Remove item":"Remove item","Decrease quantity":"Decrease quantity","Increase quantity":"Increase quantity","I can help you find the right fit":"I can help you find the right fit","Recommended":"Recommended","Option":"Option","sold out":"sold out","Size chart":"Size chart","Size recommendation":"Size recommendation","Product dimensions":"Product dimensions","Swipe to see all columns":"Swipe to see all columns","Hide extra columns":"Hide extra columns","Showing {visible} of {total} sizes":"Showing {visible} of {total} sizes","Show less":"Show less","Teaser title":"Don’t miss out 👋","Welcome message description":"How can we help?","Welcome message title":"Hi there👋","Offline status":"Usually reply in a few minutes","Welcome message by quick replies":"Hi there 👋. How can we help you today?"},"FAQ Suggestions":{},"Campaign":{"QdhVHib40u6DuUtyicuI":{"replyPlaceholder":"Click to reply","message":"<p>Hi there 👋</p><p>How can we help you?</p>","productMessage":"<p>You might like this product!</p>","discountMessage":"<p>Hey there! 🎉</p><p>We've got an exclusive Black Friday coupon just for you. Click to get your discount! Limited time only!</p>","usageInstruction":"This coupon is valid for summer clothing, with all items eligible for a 20% discount","quickQuestions":[{"id":1,"content":"Is this item still available?"},{"id":2,"content":"How fast is shipping?"},{"id":3,"content":"Which size should I choose?"}],"shopNowButton":"Shop now"}},"FAQs":{"g9dBEXvSIQokV4ysLfsN":{"questions":[{"featured":true,"originalAnswer":"<p style=\"font-family: Inter;\">A room air conditioner is ideal for rooms up to 200sq. ft. where one of the walls is exposed to the outside. In case of budget and space constraints, one could go for a Window AC.</p><p style=\"font-family: Inter;\"><br></p><p style=\"font-family: Inter;\">Though window units are cheaper and easy to install, Split ACs are quieter in operation, more aesthetically appealing and have better air distribution. If there are no exposed walls, a Split AC is the only option. Split ACs have two units - a compressor unit outside and an indoor unit inside. Since the compressor is kept outside, noise levels are lower in a split air conditioner as compared to the window air conditioner. However, installing the split units may require some renovation work, which implies a monetary investment.</p>","questionId":"tqfyCraX4cp9QWiAyHMP","originalQuestion":"Should one buy a Split AC or a Window AC?","question":"Should one buy a Split AC or a Window AC?","answer":"<p style=\"font-family: Inter;\">A room air conditioner is ideal for rooms up to 200sq. ft. where one of the walls is exposed to the outside. In case of budget and space constraints, one could go for a Window AC.</p><p style=\"font-family: Inter;\"><br></p><p style=\"font-family: Inter;\">Though window units are cheaper and easy to install, Split ACs are quieter in operation, more aesthetically appealing and have better air distribution. If there are no exposed walls, a Split AC is the only option. Split ACs have two units - a compressor unit outside and an indoor unit inside. Since the compressor is kept outside, noise levels are lower in a split air conditioner as compared to the window air conditioner. However, installing the split units may require some renovation work, which implies a monetary investment.</p>","published":true,"isOutOfDate":false,"categoryId":"g9dBEXvSIQokV4ysLfsN"},{"featured":true,"originalAnswer":"<p style=\"font-family: Inter;\">One should look out for various types of filters available in an AC, such as a bio filter and a catching filter which traps dust particles, mites as well as eliminates bacteria and viruses. Thus, the air inhaled is pure and healthy.</p><p style=\"font-family: Inter;\"><br></p><p style=\"font-family: Inter;\">Most air conditioning units also have a dehumidifier, which reduces humidity in the air, making it cooler and more comfortable.</p><p style=\"font-family: Inter;\"><br></p><p style=\"font-family: Inter;\">Also, one should check the noise level of the model, which usually ranges from 30-60 decibels.</p><p style=\"font-family: Inter;\"><br></p><p style=\"font-family: Inter;\">The sleep mode of an AC is an intelligent feature as it automatically adjusts the temperature during the night so that its comfortable throughout.</p><p style=\"font-family: Inter;\"><br></p><p style=\"font-family: Inter;\">An auto restart facility to help restore the original setting after a power break.</p><p style=\"font-family: Inter;\"><br></p><p style=\"font-family: Inter;\">Having a timer in the AC enables the users to turn it on or off on schedule.</p><p style=\"font-family: Inter;\"><br></p><p style=\"font-family: Inter;\">A feature called ‘i-feel’ helps in maintaining the set temperature around the person rather than the air conditioner. A sensor on the remote signals the thermostat in the unit, which adjusts the cooling accordingly, making it more comfortable.</p>","questionId":"U8D9IJnc7JPllIL9Felo","originalQuestion":"What are some useful points to keep in mind while purchasing an AC?","question":"What are some useful points to keep in mind while purchasing an AC?","answer":"<p style=\"font-family: Inter;\">One should look out for various types of filters available in an AC, such as a bio filter and a catching filter which traps dust particles, mites as well as eliminates bacteria and viruses. Thus, the air inhaled is pure and healthy.</p><p style=\"font-family: Inter;\"><br></p><p style=\"font-family: Inter;\">Most air conditioning units also have a dehumidifier, which reduces humidity in the air, making it cooler and more comfortable.</p><p style=\"font-family: Inter;\"><br></p><p style=\"font-family: Inter;\">Also, one should check the noise level of the model, which usually ranges from 30-60 decibels.</p><p style=\"font-family: Inter;\"><br></p><p style=\"font-family: Inter;\">The sleep mode of an AC is an intelligent feature as it automatically adjusts the temperature during the night so that its comfortable throughout.</p><p style=\"font-family: Inter;\"><br></p><p style=\"font-family: Inter;\">An auto restart facility to help restore the original setting after a power break.</p><p style=\"font-family: Inter;\"><br></p><p style=\"font-family: Inter;\">Having a timer in the AC enables the users to turn it on or off on schedule.</p><p style=\"font-family: Inter;\"><br></p><p style=\"font-family: Inter;\">A feature called ‘i-feel’ helps in maintaining the set temperature around the person rather than the air conditioner. A sensor on the remote signals the thermostat in the unit, which adjusts the cooling accordingly, making it more comfortable.</p>","published":true,"isOutOfDate":false,"categoryId":"g9dBEXvSIQokV4ysLfsN"},{"featured":true,"originalAnswer":"<p style=\"font-family: Inter;\"><strong>Standard Installation Costs</strong></p><p style=\"font-family: Inter;\"><br></p><p style=\"font-family: Inter;\"><strong>Air Conditioner Category : Installation Cost*</strong></p><p style=\"font-family: Inter;\">1. Window Air Conditioners: ₹650/- (+GST)</p><p style=\"font-family: Inter;\">2. Portable Air Conditioners: ₹650/- (+GST)</p><p style=\"font-family: Inter;\">3. Split Air Conditioners: ₹1199/- (+GST)</p><p style=\"font-family: Inter;\"><br></p><p style=\"font-family: Inter;\"><strong>Download \"Blue Star Customer Care APP\" Before installation and avail of the special offer on Split Air Conditioners: ₹999/- (GST)</strong></p><p style=\"font-family: Inter;\"><br></p><p style=\"font-family: Inter;\"><strong>*Limited-period offer valid for residential usage only.</strong></p>","questionId":"GyA1yFyzPxSxCUavONJ8","originalQuestion":"What does one pay for AC installation?","question":"What does one pay for AC installation?","answer":"<p style=\"font-family: Inter;\"><strong>Standard Installation Costs</strong></p><p style=\"font-family: Inter;\"><br></p><p style=\"font-family: Inter;\"><strong>Air Conditioner Category : Installation Cost*</strong></p><p style=\"font-family: Inter;\">1. Window Air Conditioners: ₹650/- (+GST)</p><p style=\"font-family: Inter;\">2. Portable Air Conditioners: ₹650/- (+GST)</p><p style=\"font-family: Inter;\">3. Split Air Conditioners: ₹1199/- (+GST)</p><p style=\"font-family: Inter;\"><br></p><p style=\"font-family: Inter;\"><strong>Download \"Blue Star Customer Care APP\" Before installation and avail of the special offer on Split Air Conditioners: ₹999/- (GST)</strong></p><p style=\"font-family: Inter;\"><br></p><p style=\"font-family: Inter;\"><strong>*Limited-period offer valid for residential usage only.</strong></p>","published":true,"isOutOfDate":false,"categoryId":"g9dBEXvSIQokV4ysLfsN"},{"featured":true,"originalAnswer":"<p style=\"font-family: Inter;\">You can register your product warranty with Blue Star by visiting https://www.bluestarindia.com/customer-service/warranty-registration and follow instructions therein.</p>","questionId":"DqojTSzFr2r3DI8hRgzv","originalQuestion":"How can someone register their product warranty online?","question":"How can someone register their product warranty online?","answer":"<p style=\"font-family: Inter;\">You can register your product warranty with Blue Star by visiting https://www.bluestarindia.com/customer-service/warranty-registration and follow instructions therein.</p>","published":true,"isOutOfDate":false,"categoryId":"g9dBEXvSIQokV4ysLfsN"},{"featured":true,"originalAnswer":"<p style=\"font-family: Inter;\">To know what tonnage of AC to buy, one needs to do a heat load calculation of the room to be air conditioned. Very often, a thumb of rule of 100 sq. ft. = 1.0 Tr is applied to calculate the room AC tonnage. However, this method may not be accurate.</p><p style=\"font-family: Inter;\"><br></p><p style=\"font-family: Inter;\">The size of the windows, location of the walls (west or east facing), floor, number of people expected to occupy the room, other gadgets in the room and lighting, amongst others, all play a role in calculating the right tonnage for the room. It is recommended to request a technician to visit the room and allow him to do a heat load calculation.</p><p style=\"font-family: Inter;\"><br></p><p style=\"font-family: Inter;\">Identifying the right AC tonnage is a critical step, since buying an undersized air conditioner may provide inadequate cooling with perhaps the compressor never cutting off, and buying an oversized one may result in high power bills.</p>","questionId":"OBAzqOLOI4tdBKHRAX1O","originalQuestion":"What is the right AC tonnage for my room?","question":"What is the right AC tonnage for my room?","answer":"<p style=\"font-family: Inter;\">To know what tonnage of AC to buy, one needs to do a heat load calculation of the room to be air conditioned. Very often, a thumb of rule of 100 sq. ft. = 1.0 Tr is applied to calculate the room AC tonnage. However, this method may not be accurate.</p><p style=\"font-family: Inter;\"><br></p><p style=\"font-family: Inter;\">The size of the windows, location of the walls (west or east facing), floor, number of people expected to occupy the room, other gadgets in the room and lighting, amongst others, all play a role in calculating the right tonnage for the room. It is recommended to request a technician to visit the room and allow him to do a heat load calculation.</p><p style=\"font-family: Inter;\"><br></p><p style=\"font-family: Inter;\">Identifying the right AC tonnage is a critical step, since buying an undersized air conditioner may provide inadequate cooling with perhaps the compressor never cutting off, and buying an oversized one may result in high power bills.</p>","published":true,"isOutOfDate":false,"categoryId":"g9dBEXvSIQokV4ysLfsN"},{"featured":true,"originalAnswer":"<p style=\"font-family: Inter;\">High energy efficiency design involves increased components in the heat exchange area due to which input costs increase. Hence, a higher star AC, such as a 5 star AC, costs more than a 2 star one.</p><p style=\"font-family: Inter;\"><br></p><p style=\"font-family: Inter;\">To make an informed choice related to energy and monetary benefits in an AC, one needs to calculate the energy and corresponding monetary savings. Payback period in years = incremental higher price/energy saving in a year over a lower star AC.</p><p style=\"font-family: Inter;\"><br></p><p style=\"font-family: Inter;\">Buying a 5 Star AC is a good decision in the long term, especially given the fact that consumers nowadays use their air conditioners for much longer periods and the power tariff is likely to increase over the years.</p>","questionId":"delMswf3WLTQBrierRYR","originalQuestion":"Why does a higher star AC cost more? How to calculate the payback period?","question":"Why does a higher star AC cost more? How to calculate the payback period?","answer":"<p style=\"font-family: Inter;\">High energy efficiency design involves increased components in the heat exchange area due to which input costs increase. Hence, a higher star AC, such as a 5 star AC, costs more than a 2 star one.</p><p style=\"font-family: Inter;\"><br></p><p style=\"font-family: Inter;\">To make an informed choice related to energy and monetary benefits in an AC, one needs to calculate the energy and corresponding monetary savings. Payback period in years = incremental higher price/energy saving in a year over a lower star AC.</p><p style=\"font-family: Inter;\"><br></p><p style=\"font-family: Inter;\">Buying a 5 Star AC is a good decision in the long term, especially given the fact that consumers nowadays use their air conditioners for much longer periods and the power tariff is likely to increase over the years.</p>","published":true,"isOutOfDate":false,"categoryId":"g9dBEXvSIQokV4ysLfsN"},{"featured":true,"originalAnswer":"<p style=\"font-family: Inter;\">The star rating of an air conditioner is an indicator of its energy efficiency and is certified by the Bureau of Energy Efficiency (BEE). The star rating aims to help buyers understand the energy efficiency of an Air Conditioner. More the stars, the higher the energy savings and lower the energy bills for the user. As an air conditioner buyer, you can see a Star Label with the ISEER (Indian Seasonal Energy Efficient Ratio) rating standards affixed on the air conditioner. These vary from 1 star to 5 stars, with 1 star being the lowest and 5 stars being the highest in terms of energy efficiency. Blue Star air conditioners are stringently tested and qualify for the BEE energy rating standards.</p>","questionId":"dip9eOgVmr2nlxSz6EJ2","originalQuestion":"How does the star rating system help consumers choose an energy-efficient air conditioner?","question":"How does the star rating system help consumers choose an energy-efficient air conditioner?","answer":"<p style=\"font-family: Inter;\">The star rating of an air conditioner is an indicator of its energy efficiency and is certified by the Bureau of Energy Efficiency (BEE). The star rating aims to help buyers understand the energy efficiency of an Air Conditioner. More the stars, the higher the energy savings and lower the energy bills for the user. As an air conditioner buyer, you can see a Star Label with the ISEER (Indian Seasonal Energy Efficient Ratio) rating standards affixed on the air conditioner. These vary from 1 star to 5 stars, with 1 star being the lowest and 5 stars being the highest in terms of energy efficiency. Blue Star air conditioners are stringently tested and qualify for the BEE energy rating standards.</p>","published":true,"isOutOfDate":false,"categoryId":"g9dBEXvSIQokV4ysLfsN"},{"featured":true,"originalAnswer":"<p style=\"font-family: Inter;\">One should note the star labelling on the AC. The star rating varies from 1 star to 5 star. More the stars, the more energy efficient the AC is, better will be the corresponding savings.</p><p style=\"font-family: Inter;\">The star rating is defined by the Bureau of Energy Efficiency guidelines and air conditioners of all brands are tested and certified by a third party agency for the star-rating.</p>","questionId":"DDkwfxwWKrfVeqf9XbGs","originalQuestion":"How does one know if the AC being considered is energy efficient?","question":"How does one know if the AC being considered is energy efficient?","answer":"<p style=\"font-family: Inter;\">One should note the star labelling on the AC. The star rating varies from 1 star to 5 star. More the stars, the more energy efficient the AC is, better will be the corresponding savings.</p><p style=\"font-family: Inter;\">The star rating is defined by the Bureau of Energy Efficiency guidelines and air conditioners of all brands are tested and certified by a third party agency for the star-rating.</p>","published":true,"isOutOfDate":false,"categoryId":"g9dBEXvSIQokV4ysLfsN"},{"featured":true,"originalAnswer":"<p style=\"font-family: Inter;\">Filter cleaning depends on the frequency of usage and the atmospheric conditions. For normal applications, it is recommended to clean the filter once every 15 days.</p><p style=\"font-family: Inter;\"><br></p><p style=\"font-family: Inter;\">Also, the AC should be serviced once every 3-4 months for optimal performance and longer life of the machine.</p>","questionId":"MY7V7WxPHvealwjQNZf9","originalQuestion":"How often should the filters be cleaned?","question":"How often should the filters be cleaned?","answer":"<p style=\"font-family: Inter;\">Filter cleaning depends on the frequency of usage and the atmospheric conditions. For normal applications, it is recommended to clean the filter once every 15 days.</p><p style=\"font-family: Inter;\"><br></p><p style=\"font-family: Inter;\">Also, the AC should be serviced once every 3-4 months for optimal performance and longer life of the machine.</p>","published":true,"isOutOfDate":false,"categoryId":"g9dBEXvSIQokV4ysLfsN"},{"featured":false,"originalAnswer":"<p style=\"font-family: Inter;\">If the order has not been processed or dispatched yet, it can be cancelled by contacting our customer care team at +91 8828831177.</p>","questionId":"TOVwAYVaBrvWBnInEDk6","originalQuestion":"What is the order cancellation policy?","question":"What is the order cancellation policy?","answer":"<p style=\"font-family: Inter;\">If the order has not been processed or dispatched yet, it can be cancelled by contacting our customer care team at +91 8828831177.</p>","published":true,"isOutOfDate":false,"categoryId":"g9dBEXvSIQokV4ysLfsN"}],"createdAt":"2024-09-04T13:00:42.243Z","icon":"cart","published":true,"isOutOfDate":false,"position":3,"categoryId":"g9dBEXvSIQokV4ysLfsN","featured":true,"originalQuestion":"Frequently Asked Questions","question":"Frequently Asked Questions"},"ZtvSKoeSRaHTNJPiekx0":{"questions":[{"featured":true,"originalAnswer":"<p style=\"font-family: Inter;\">Window and standard split air conditioners have a compressor that runs at a fixed speed. The compressor is therefore either on or off depending on the set temperature.</p><p style=\"font-family: Inter;\"><br></p><p style=\"font-family: Inter;\">The Inverter AC thinks and adjusts according to your needs. Its compressor has a variable speed and changes its frequency according to the ambient load. As the frequency changes, the speed of the compressor also changes. This eliminates any temperature fluctuations and helps maintain a comfortable temperature. For example, a 1.5 Tr inverter AC can decrease its capacity to 1 Tr or increase its capacity to 1.75 Tr, as per the requirement. As there is no cut in and cut off, the Inverter AC saves up to 30% more power.</p>","questionId":"RoDAj2TF4ioI183YeSGC","originalQuestion":"What is an Inverter AC?","question":"What is an Inverter AC?","answer":"<p style=\"font-family: Inter;\">Window and standard split air conditioners have a compressor that runs at a fixed speed. The compressor is therefore either on or off depending on the set temperature.</p><p style=\"font-family: Inter;\"><br></p><p style=\"font-family: Inter;\">The Inverter AC thinks and adjusts according to your needs. Its compressor has a variable speed and changes its frequency according to the ambient load. As the frequency changes, the speed of the compressor also changes. This eliminates any temperature fluctuations and helps maintain a comfortable temperature. For example, a 1.5 Tr inverter AC can decrease its capacity to 1 Tr or increase its capacity to 1.75 Tr, as per the requirement. As there is no cut in and cut off, the Inverter AC saves up to 30% more power.</p>","published":true,"isOutOfDate":false,"categoryId":"ZtvSKoeSRaHTNJPiekx0"},{"featured":true,"originalAnswer":"<p style=\"font-family: Inter;\">Convertible Cooling empowers users to select the desired cooling capacity. With just a touch of a button on the remote, one can adjust the AC's cooling capacity from 100% down to 80%, 60%, and even 40%. This adaptability ensures that you can enjoy the perfect level of cooling tailored to your specific comfort requirements and the prevailing ambient conditions.</p>","questionId":"XYz14vu5PO1jjDCB6ddm","originalQuestion":"How does Convertible Cooling work?","question":"How does Convertible Cooling work?","answer":"<p style=\"font-family: Inter;\">Convertible Cooling empowers users to select the desired cooling capacity. With just a touch of a button on the remote, one can adjust the AC's cooling capacity from 100% down to 80%, 60%, and even 40%. This adaptability ensures that you can enjoy the perfect level of cooling tailored to your specific comfort requirements and the prevailing ambient conditions.</p>","published":true,"isOutOfDate":false,"categoryId":"ZtvSKoeSRaHTNJPiekx0"},{"featured":true,"originalAnswer":"<p style=\"font-family: Inter;\">AI Pro senses the ambient temperature outside and the conditions inside the room. It then intelligently optimises the cooling and fan speed to ensure maximum comfort. AI Pro can be enabled by pressing the mode button on the AC remote.</p>","questionId":"O5WQMH4m5f8vZZTxhOkG","originalQuestion":"Does AI Pro automatically adjust the cooling? How can I activate the AI Pro mode?","question":"Does AI Pro automatically adjust the cooling? How can I activate the AI Pro mode?","answer":"<p style=\"font-family: Inter;\">AI Pro senses the ambient temperature outside and the conditions inside the room. It then intelligently optimises the cooling and fan speed to ensure maximum comfort. AI Pro can be enabled by pressing the mode button on the AC remote.</p>","published":true,"isOutOfDate":false,"categoryId":"ZtvSKoeSRaHTNJPiekx0"},{"featured":true,"originalAnswer":"<p style=\"font-family: Inter;\">You can access your AC from anywhere in the world just by connecting your AC to your smart phone, you can operate your AC from anywhere remotely, only with an internet connection. This is what converts your conventional AC to a Smart AC.</p>","questionId":"Icu9oLHnuiKrOmjpUC3o","originalQuestion":"What does a Smart AC mean?","question":"What does a Smart AC mean?","answer":"<p style=\"font-family: Inter;\">You can access your AC from anywhere in the world just by connecting your AC to your smart phone, you can operate your AC from anywhere remotely, only with an internet connection. This is what converts your conventional AC to a Smart AC.</p>","published":true,"isOutOfDate":false,"categoryId":"ZtvSKoeSRaHTNJPiekx0"},{"featured":true,"originalAnswer":"<p style=\"font-family: Inter;\">With the Customised Sleep feature, one can adjust the temperature and fan speed of the AC for every hour up to 12 hours. This helps the user in having a comfortable sleep throughout the night.</p>","questionId":"FrYkidmPtIYSFLNhNhMJ","originalQuestion":"What is the Customised Sleep feature?","question":"What is the Customised Sleep feature?","answer":"<p style=\"font-family: Inter;\">With the Customised Sleep feature, one can adjust the temperature and fan speed of the AC for every hour up to 12 hours. This helps the user in having a comfortable sleep throughout the night.</p>","published":true,"isOutOfDate":false,"categoryId":"ZtvSKoeSRaHTNJPiekx0"},{"featured":true,"originalAnswer":"<p style=\"font-family: Inter;\">With Voice Command Technology, the customers can operate their ACs through their smart devices like Amazon Alexa or Google Home through English or Hindi voice commands. A simple voice command like “Alexa, switch on the AC\" is all it takes to operate the AC, without the need for a remote or smartphone.</p>","questionId":"NM9EHekVu6DW7ZGqHj1Z","originalQuestion":"How can I use the Voice Command Technology?","question":"How can I use the Voice Command Technology?","answer":"<p style=\"font-family: Inter;\">With Voice Command Technology, the customers can operate their ACs through their smart devices like Amazon Alexa or Google Home through English or Hindi voice commands. A simple voice command like “Alexa, switch on the AC\" is all it takes to operate the AC, without the need for a remote or smartphone.</p>","published":true,"isOutOfDate":false,"categoryId":"ZtvSKoeSRaHTNJPiekx0"},{"featured":true,"originalAnswer":"<p style=\"font-family: Inter;\">Smart Enabled ACs come pre-equipped with a Wi-Fi PCB which makes your AC Smart at no extra cost.</p><p style=\"font-family: Inter;\"><br></p><p style=\"font-family: Inter;\">Smart Ready ACs give the consumers an option to convert their normal AC to a WI-FI enabled AC by having a small WI-FI PCB installed at an additional cost. Please get in touch with Blue Star's authorised service center to convert your normal ACs to Smart ACs.</p>","questionId":"kJ67YYRIWFePR5gooFwA","originalQuestion":"What is the difference between a Smart Enabled AC and Smart Ready AC?","question":"What is the difference between a Smart Enabled AC and Smart Ready AC?","answer":"<p style=\"font-family: Inter;\">Smart Enabled ACs come pre-equipped with a Wi-Fi PCB which makes your AC Smart at no extra cost.</p><p style=\"font-family: Inter;\"><br></p><p style=\"font-family: Inter;\">Smart Ready ACs give the consumers an option to convert their normal AC to a WI-FI enabled AC by having a small WI-FI PCB installed at an additional cost. Please get in touch with Blue Star's authorised service center to convert your normal ACs to Smart ACs.</p>","published":true,"isOutOfDate":false,"categoryId":"ZtvSKoeSRaHTNJPiekx0"},{"featured":true,"originalAnswer":"<p style=\"font-family: Inter;\">A heavy duty AC is an AC that is designed to withstand harsh conditions and provide reliable cooling. These ACs are typically used in residential, commercial and industrial applications, where they are exposed to dust, dirt, and extreme temperatures.</p>","questionId":"ep7xC41b3BHX4EnSTHmw","originalQuestion":"What is a Heavy Duty AC?","question":"What is a Heavy Duty AC?","answer":"<p style=\"font-family: Inter;\">A heavy duty AC is an AC that is designed to withstand harsh conditions and provide reliable cooling. These ACs are typically used in residential, commercial and industrial applications, where they are exposed to dust, dirt, and extreme temperatures.</p>","published":true,"isOutOfDate":false,"categoryId":"ZtvSKoeSRaHTNJPiekx0"},{"featured":true,"originalAnswer":"<p style=\"font-family: Inter;\">The Anti-Virus ACs are designed with a unique and effective anti-virus coated filter. Through its positive charge, it attracts the negatively charged viruses like a powerful magnet and deactivates them when air passes through this filter.</p><p style=\"font-family: Inter;\">The high-performance PM2.5 filter featuring activated carbon, is specifically designed to combat one of the most harmful pollutants we encounter: Particulate Matter (PM)2.5.These minute particles pose a significant health risk when inhaled. Blue Star's specialised filter creates an electrostatic shield, effectively trapping these tiny, aerosolised particles. This results in indoor air that is not only safe, but also free from unpleasant odours, offering a breath of fresh and clean air.</p>","questionId":"LgiVnHOYSiqY6zqBPBo9","originalQuestion":"How does Anti-Virus Technology work? What type of pollutants does the PM2.5 Filter target?","question":"How does Anti-Virus Technology work? What type of pollutants does the PM2.5 Filter target?","answer":"<p style=\"font-family: Inter;\">The Anti-Virus ACs are designed with a unique and effective anti-virus coated filter. Through its positive charge, it attracts the negatively charged viruses like a powerful magnet and deactivates them when air passes through this filter.</p><p style=\"font-family: Inter;\">The high-performance PM2.5 filter featuring activated carbon, is specifically designed to combat one of the most harmful pollutants we encounter: Particulate Matter (PM)2.5.These minute particles pose a significant health risk when inhaled. Blue Star's specialised filter creates an electrostatic shield, effectively trapping these tiny, aerosolised particles. This results in indoor air that is not only safe, but also free from unpleasant odours, offering a breath of fresh and clean air.</p>","published":true,"isOutOfDate":false,"categoryId":"ZtvSKoeSRaHTNJPiekx0"},{"featured":true,"originalAnswer":"<p style=\"font-family: Inter;\">Blue Star's Dynamic Drive Design Technology is a unique engineering design where the inverter drive and the compressor are balanced to achieve enhanced energy efficiency, resulting in optimised cooling capacity. As a result, the 1.0 TR Inverter Split Air Conditioners achieve 6.25 High ISEER, which is 25%* more than the current 5-Star ISEER requirements and 64%* more energy-efficient than a 3-Star Rated Inverter Split Air Conditioner.&nbsp;</p><p style=\"font-family: Inter;\">*T&amp;C Apply.</p>","questionId":"Li5aT3yIgF0C6RwCZwur","originalQuestion":"How does a Super Energy Efficient AC achieve enhanced energy efficiency?","question":"How does a Super Energy Efficient AC achieve enhanced energy efficiency?","answer":"<p style=\"font-family: Inter;\">Blue Star's Dynamic Drive Design Technology is a unique engineering design where the inverter drive and the compressor are balanced to achieve enhanced energy efficiency, resulting in optimised cooling capacity. As a result, the 1.0 TR Inverter Split Air Conditioners achieve 6.25 High ISEER, which is 25%* more than the current 5-Star ISEER requirements and 64%* more energy-efficient than a 3-Star Rated Inverter Split Air Conditioner.&nbsp;</p><p style=\"font-family: Inter;\">*T&amp;C Apply.</p>","published":true,"isOutOfDate":false,"categoryId":"ZtvSKoeSRaHTNJPiekx0"}],"createdAt":"2024-09-30T07:33:30.961Z","published":true,"isOutOfDate":false,"position":4,"categoryId":"ZtvSKoeSRaHTNJPiekx0","featured":true,"originalQuestion":"Technology Related Questions","question":"Technology Related Questions","icon":"exchange"}}} || {};

      window.AVADA_FAQ = {
        campaigns: [{"templateId":"product_recommendation","name":"Product Recommendation","status":"inactive","trigger":{"type":"after_time","value":8,"displayOn":{"type":"product","value":[]}},"condition":{"audience":"all","displayTime":"all_time","device":"all","duration":{"type":"always","value":10},"country":{"type":"all","value":[]},"filterCustomers":"all","segmentIds":[],"customerIds":[]},"message":{"productContent":"<p>You might like this product!</p>","discountContent":"<p>Hey there! 🎉</p><p>We've got an exclusive Black Friday coupon just for you. Click to get your discount! Limited time only!</p>","discount":null,"usageInstruction":"This coupon is valid for summer clothing, with all items eligible for a 20% discount","productsList":[],"productType":"best_sellers","type":"product_recommendation","content":"<p>Hi! Interested in this product? Ask me anything or get more details!</p>","contentMessageType":"quick_question","quickQuestions":[{"id":1,"content":"Is this item still available?"},{"id":2,"content":"How fast is shipping?"},{"id":3,"content":"Which size should I choose?"}],"bestSellerMessage":"Checkout our best seller!","newArrivalsMessage":"Checkout our new arrivals!","topPicksForYouMessage":"Top picks for you","backgroundColor":"#ffffff","textColor":"#232323","buttonColor":"#232323","buttonTextColor":"#ffffff"},"viewSimilarButton":"View similar","askAboutItButton":"Ask about it","viewProductButton":"View product","shopNowButton":"Shop now","priority":2,"triggered":0,"interacted":0,"createdAt":"2026-07-07T04:10:27.066Z","updatedAt":"2026-07-07T04:10:27.066Z","id":"IVeyok9giu8osEh0Gpz1"},{"name":"Subscribe Newsletter","status":"inactive","templateId":"subscribe_newsletter","trigger":{"type":"after_time","value":5,"displayOn":{"type":"all","value":[]}},"condition":{"audience":"all","displayTime":"all_time","device":"all","duration":{"type":"always","value":10},"country":{"type":"all","value":[]},"filterCustomers":"all","segmentIds":[],"customerIds":[]},"message":{"type":"discount","content":"<p>Discover your special offer waiting just for you!</p>","discount":null,"marketingOptIn":false,"formFields":["email"],"successMessage":"Thank you for subscribing! Check your inbox and stay tuned for the latest news and exclusive offers.","emailMessage":"Check your email to confirm your subscription.","triggerButtonText":"Yes, sure!","usageInstruction":"This coupon is valid for summer clothing, with all items eligible for a 20% discount.","introduction":"Subscribe to get hot deals, exclusive updates and rewards.","backgroundColor":"#ffffff","textColor":"#232323","buttonColor":"#232323","buttonTextColor":"#ffffff"},"shopNowButton":"Shop now","subscribeButton":"Subscribe","priority":4,"triggered":0,"interacted":0,"createdAt":"2026-07-07T04:10:27.066Z","updatedAt":"2026-07-07T04:10:27.066Z","id":"Ptwlq3jiSDtoo6gd18Iz"},{"templateId":"search_page","name":"Search page","status":"inactive","trigger":{"type":"after_time","value":5},"condition":{"audience":"all","displayTime":"all_time","device":"all","duration":{"type":"always","value":10},"country":{"type":"all","value":[]},"filterCustomers":"all","segmentIds":[],"customerIds":[]},"message":{"type":"text","content":"<p>Can I help you find the perfect product? 😊</p>","contentMessageType":"custom_message","quickQuestions":[{"id":1,"content":"What is the best product?"},{"id":2,"content":"What is on sale?"},{"id":3,"content":"Can you suggest products for me?"}],"backgroundColor":"#ffffff","textColor":"#232323","buttonColor":"#232323","buttonTextColor":"#ffffff","replyPlaceholder":"Click to reply"},"priority":3,"triggered":0,"interacted":0,"createdAt":"2026-07-07T04:10:27.066Z","updatedAt":"2026-07-07T04:10:27.066Z","id":"QNMzHmllcdFUsvTjkx8r"},{"name":"Welcome visitors","status":"active","templateId":"welcome_message","trigger":{"type":"after_time","value":5,"displayOn":{"type":"all","value":[]}},"condition":{"audience":"all","displayTime":"all_time","device":"all","duration":{"type":"always","value":10},"country":{"type":"all","value":[]},"filterCustomers":"all","segmentIds":[],"customerIds":[]},"contentMessageType":"custom_message","quickQuestions":[{"id":1,"content":"Is this item still available?"},{"id":2,"content":"How fast is shipping?"},{"id":3,"content":"Which size should I choose?"}],"message":{"productContent":"<p>You might like this product!</p>","discountContent":"<p>Hey there! 🎉</p><p>We've got an exclusive Black Friday coupon just for you. Click to get your discount! Limited time only!</p>","discount":null,"usageInstruction":"This coupon is valid for summer clothing, with all items eligible for a 20% discount","productsList":[],"productType":"best_sellers","type":"text","content":"<p>Hi there 👋</p><p>How can we help you?</p>","replyPlaceholder":"Click to reply","backgroundColor":"#ffffff","textColor":"#232323","buttonColor":"#232323","buttonTextColor":"#ffffff"},"viewSimilarButton":"View similar","askAboutItButton":"Ask about it","viewProductButton":"View product","shopNowButton":"Shop now","priority":1,"triggered":0,"interacted":0,"createdAt":"2026-07-07T04:10:27.066Z","updatedAt":"2026-07-07T04:10:27.066Z","id":"QdhVHib40u6DuUtyicuI"}] || [],
        questions: [{"createdAt":"2024-09-04T13:17:48.557Z","featured":false,"answer":"<p style=\"font-family: Inter;\">-<img src=\"data:image/png;base64,\"></p><p style=\"font-family: Inter;\"><br></p>","question":"What does one pay for AC installation?","shopId":"pFjHphiT9hlE94A2WnJk","categoryId":"g9dBEXvSIQokV4ysLfsN","questionId":"3ztKhDelHZBPLuoTKfO1"},{"createdAt":"2024-09-04T13:18:12.354Z","featured":false,"answer":"<p style=\"font-family: Inter;\">-<img src=\"data:image/png;base64,\"></p><p style=\"font-family: Inter;\"><br></p>","question":"What does one pay for AC installation?","shopId":"pFjHphiT9hlE94A2WnJk","categoryId":"g9dBEXvSIQokV4ysLfsN","questionId":"58aMj3EHgPk9ua8oEaUX"},{"createdAt":"2024-09-04T13:21:34.149Z","featured":true,"shopId":"pFjHphiT9hlE94A2WnJk","categoryId":"g9dBEXvSIQokV4ysLfsN","answer":"<p style=\"font-family: Inter;\">One should note the star labelling on the AC. The star rating varies from 1 star to 5 star. More the stars, the more energy efficient the AC is, better will be the corresponding savings.</p><p style=\"font-family: Inter;\">The star rating is defined by the Bureau of Energy Efficiency guidelines and air conditioners of all brands are tested and certified by a third party agency for the star-rating.</p>","question":"How does one know if the AC being considered is energy efficient?","updatedAt":"2024-09-26T09:30:25.508Z","published":true,"questionId":"DDkwfxwWKrfVeqf9XbGs"},{"createdAt":"2024-09-04T13:20:02.374Z","featured":true,"shopId":"pFjHphiT9hlE94A2WnJk","categoryId":"g9dBEXvSIQokV4ysLfsN","answer":"<p style=\"font-family: Inter;\">You can register your product warranty with Blue Star by visiting https://www.bluestarindia.com/customer-service/warranty-registration and follow instructions therein.</p>","question":"How can someone register their product warranty online?","updatedAt":"2024-09-26T09:26:24.889Z","published":true,"questionId":"DqojTSzFr2r3DI8hRgzv"},{"createdAt":"2024-09-30T07:35:56.548Z","answer":"<p style=\"font-family: Inter;\">With the Customised Sleep feature, one can adjust the temperature and fan speed of the AC for every hour up to 12 hours. This helps the user in having a comfortable sleep throughout the night.</p>","question":"What is the Customised Sleep feature?","shopId":"pFjHphiT9hlE94A2WnJk","categoryId":"ZtvSKoeSRaHTNJPiekx0","featured":true,"updatedAt":"2024-09-30T07:40:36.034Z","published":true,"questionId":"FrYkidmPtIYSFLNhNhMJ"},{"createdAt":"2024-09-04T13:14:57.948Z","shopId":"pFjHphiT9hlE94A2WnJk","categoryId":"g9dBEXvSIQokV4ysLfsN","featured":true,"question":"What does one pay for AC installation?","answer":"<p style=\"font-family: Inter;\"><strong>Standard Installation Costs</strong></p><p style=\"font-family: Inter;\"><br></p><p style=\"font-family: Inter;\"><strong>Air Conditioner Category : Installation Cost*</strong></p><p style=\"font-family: Inter;\">1. Window Air Conditioners: ₹650/- (+GST)</p><p style=\"font-family: Inter;\">2. Portable Air Conditioners: ₹650/- (+GST)</p><p style=\"font-family: Inter;\">3. Split Air Conditioners: ₹1199/- (+GST)</p><p style=\"font-family: Inter;\"><br></p><p style=\"font-family: Inter;\"><strong>Download \"Blue Star Customer Care APP\" Before installation and avail of the special offer on Split Air Conditioners: ₹999/- (GST)</strong></p><p style=\"font-family: Inter;\"><br></p><p style=\"font-family: Inter;\"><strong>*Limited-period offer valid for residential usage only.</strong></p>","updatedAt":"2024-09-26T09:44:59.515Z","published":true,"questionId":"GyA1yFyzPxSxCUavONJ8"},{"createdAt":"2024-09-30T07:35:32.600Z","answer":"<p style=\"font-family: Inter;\">You can access your AC from anywhere in the world just by connecting your AC to your smart phone, you can operate your AC from anywhere remotely, only with an internet connection. This is what converts your conventional AC to a Smart AC.</p>","question":"What does a Smart AC mean?","shopId":"pFjHphiT9hlE94A2WnJk","categoryId":"ZtvSKoeSRaHTNJPiekx0","featured":true,"updatedAt":"2024-09-30T07:40:33.328Z","published":true,"questionId":"Icu9oLHnuiKrOmjpUC3o"},{"createdAt":"2024-09-30T07:37:29.472Z","answer":"<p style=\"font-family: Inter;\">The Anti-Virus ACs are designed with a unique and effective anti-virus coated filter. Through its positive charge, it attracts the negatively charged viruses like a powerful magnet and deactivates them when air passes through this filter.</p><p style=\"font-family: Inter;\">The high-performance PM2.5 filter featuring activated carbon, is specifically designed to combat one of the most harmful pollutants we encounter: Particulate Matter (PM)2.5.These minute particles pose a significant health risk when inhaled. Blue Star's specialised filter creates an electrostatic shield, effectively trapping these tiny, aerosolised particles. This results in indoor air that is not only safe, but also free from unpleasant odours, offering a breath of fresh and clean air.</p>","question":"How does Anti-Virus Technology work? What type of pollutants does the PM2.5 Filter target?","shopId":"pFjHphiT9hlE94A2WnJk","categoryId":"ZtvSKoeSRaHTNJPiekx0","featured":true,"updatedAt":"2024-09-30T07:40:43.246Z","published":true,"questionId":"LgiVnHOYSiqY6zqBPBo9"},{"createdAt":"2024-09-30T07:37:52.771Z","answer":"<p style=\"font-family: Inter;\">Blue Star's Dynamic Drive Design Technology is a unique engineering design where the inverter drive and the compressor are balanced to achieve enhanced energy efficiency, resulting in optimised cooling capacity. As a result, the 1.0 TR Inverter Split Air Conditioners achieve 6.25 High ISEER, which is 25%* more than the current 5-Star ISEER requirements and 64%* more energy-efficient than a 3-Star Rated Inverter Split Air Conditioner.&nbsp;</p><p style=\"font-family: Inter;\">*T&amp;C Apply.</p>","question":"How does a Super Energy Efficient AC achieve enhanced energy efficiency?","shopId":"pFjHphiT9hlE94A2WnJk","categoryId":"ZtvSKoeSRaHTNJPiekx0","featured":true,"updatedAt":"2024-09-30T07:40:45.300Z","published":true,"questionId":"Li5aT3yIgF0C6RwCZwur"},{"createdAt":"2024-09-04T13:21:50.719Z","shopId":"pFjHphiT9hlE94A2WnJk","categoryId":"g9dBEXvSIQokV4ysLfsN","featured":true,"answer":"<p style=\"font-family: Inter;\">Filter cleaning depends on the frequency of usage and the atmospheric conditions. For normal applications, it is recommended to clean the filter once every 15 days.</p><p style=\"font-family: Inter;\"><br></p><p style=\"font-family: Inter;\">Also, the AC should be serviced once every 3-4 months for optimal performance and longer life of the machine.</p>","question":"How often should the filters be cleaned?","updatedAt":"2024-09-26T09:30:54.695Z","published":true,"questionId":"MY7V7WxPHvealwjQNZf9"},{"createdAt":"2024-09-30T07:36:27.504Z","answer":"<p style=\"font-family: Inter;\">With Voice Command Technology, the customers can operate their ACs through their smart devices like Amazon Alexa or Google Home through English or Hindi voice commands. A simple voice command like “Alexa, switch on the AC\" is all it takes to operate the AC, without the need for a remote or smartphone.</p>","question":"How can I use the Voice Command Technology?","shopId":"pFjHphiT9hlE94A2WnJk","categoryId":"ZtvSKoeSRaHTNJPiekx0","featured":true,"updatedAt":"2024-09-30T07:40:37.813Z","published":true,"questionId":"NM9EHekVu6DW7ZGqHj1Z"},{"createdAt":"2024-09-30T07:35:09.857Z","answer":"<p style=\"font-family: Inter;\">AI Pro senses the ambient temperature outside and the conditions inside the room. It then intelligently optimises the cooling and fan speed to ensure maximum comfort. AI Pro can be enabled by pressing the mode button on the AC remote.</p>","question":"Does AI Pro automatically adjust the cooling? How can I activate the AI Pro mode?","shopId":"pFjHphiT9hlE94A2WnJk","categoryId":"ZtvSKoeSRaHTNJPiekx0","featured":true,"updatedAt":"2024-09-30T07:40:27.709Z","published":true,"questionId":"O5WQMH4m5f8vZZTxhOkG"},{"createdAt":"2024-09-04T13:20:21.893Z","featured":true,"question":"What is the right AC tonnage for my room?","shopId":"pFjHphiT9hlE94A2WnJk","categoryId":"g9dBEXvSIQokV4ysLfsN","answer":"<p style=\"font-family: Inter;\">To know what tonnage of AC to buy, one needs to do a heat load calculation of the room to be air conditioned. Very often, a thumb of rule of 100 sq. ft. = 1.0 Tr is applied to calculate the room AC tonnage. However, this method may not be accurate.</p><p style=\"font-family: Inter;\"><br></p><p style=\"font-family: Inter;\">The size of the windows, location of the walls (west or east facing), floor, number of people expected to occupy the room, other gadgets in the room and lighting, amongst others, all play a role in calculating the right tonnage for the room. It is recommended to request a technician to visit the room and allow him to do a heat load calculation.</p><p style=\"font-family: Inter;\"><br></p><p style=\"font-family: Inter;\">Identifying the right AC tonnage is a critical step, since buying an undersized air conditioner may provide inadequate cooling with perhaps the compressor never cutting off, and buying an oversized one may result in high power bills.</p>","updatedAt":"2024-09-26T09:27:41.587Z","published":true,"questionId":"OBAzqOLOI4tdBKHRAX1O"},{"createdAt":"2024-09-30T07:34:07.783Z","answer":"<p style=\"font-family: Inter;\">Window and standard split air conditioners have a compressor that runs at a fixed speed. The compressor is therefore either on or off depending on the set temperature.</p><p style=\"font-family: Inter;\"><br></p><p style=\"font-family: Inter;\">The Inverter AC thinks and adjusts according to your needs. Its compressor has a variable speed and changes its frequency according to the ambient load. As the frequency changes, the speed of the compressor also changes. This eliminates any temperature fluctuations and helps maintain a comfortable temperature. For example, a 1.5 Tr inverter AC can decrease its capacity to 1 Tr or increase its capacity to 1.75 Tr, as per the requirement. As there is no cut in and cut off, the Inverter AC saves up to 30% more power.</p>","question":"What is an Inverter AC?","shopId":"pFjHphiT9hlE94A2WnJk","categoryId":"ZtvSKoeSRaHTNJPiekx0","featured":true,"updatedAt":"2024-09-30T07:40:24.892Z","published":true,"questionId":"RoDAj2TF4ioI183YeSGC"},{"createdAt":"2024-09-30T10:29:32.604Z","featured":false,"answer":"<p style=\"font-family: Inter;\">If the order has not been processed or dispatched yet, it can be cancelled by contacting our customer care team at +91 8828831177.</p>","question":"What is the order cancellation policy?","shopId":"pFjHphiT9hlE94A2WnJk","categoryId":"g9dBEXvSIQokV4ysLfsN","published":true,"questionId":"TOVwAYVaBrvWBnInEDk6"},{"createdAt":"2024-09-04T13:01:58.006Z","shopId":"pFjHphiT9hlE94A2WnJk","categoryId":"g9dBEXvSIQokV4ysLfsN","featured":true,"answer":"<p style=\"font-family: Inter;\">One should look out for various types of filters available in an AC, such as a bio filter and a catching filter which traps dust particles, mites as well as eliminates bacteria and viruses. Thus, the air inhaled is pure and healthy.</p><p style=\"font-family: Inter;\"><br></p><p style=\"font-family: Inter;\">Most air conditioning units also have a dehumidifier, which reduces humidity in the air, making it cooler and more comfortable.</p><p style=\"font-family: Inter;\"><br></p><p style=\"font-family: Inter;\">Also, one should check the noise level of the model, which usually ranges from 30-60 decibels.</p><p style=\"font-family: Inter;\"><br></p><p style=\"font-family: Inter;\">The sleep mode of an AC is an intelligent feature as it automatically adjusts the temperature during the night so that its comfortable throughout.</p><p style=\"font-family: Inter;\"><br></p><p style=\"font-family: Inter;\">An auto restart facility to help restore the original setting after a power break.</p><p style=\"font-family: Inter;\"><br></p><p style=\"font-family: Inter;\">Having a timer in the AC enables the users to turn it on or off on schedule.</p><p style=\"font-family: Inter;\"><br></p><p style=\"font-family: Inter;\">A feature called ‘i-feel’ helps in maintaining the set temperature around the person rather than the air conditioner. A sensor on the remote signals the thermostat in the unit, which adjusts the cooling accordingly, making it more comfortable.</p>","question":"What are some useful points to keep in mind while purchasing an AC?","updatedAt":"2024-09-26T09:22:39.780Z","published":true,"questionId":"U8D9IJnc7JPllIL9Felo"},{"createdAt":"2024-09-30T07:34:43.413Z","answer":"<p style=\"font-family: Inter;\">Convertible Cooling empowers users to select the desired cooling capacity. With just a touch of a button on the remote, one can adjust the AC's cooling capacity from 100% down to 80%, 60%, and even 40%. This adaptability ensures that you can enjoy the perfect level of cooling tailored to your specific comfort requirements and the prevailing ambient conditions.</p>","question":"How does Convertible Cooling work?","shopId":"pFjHphiT9hlE94A2WnJk","categoryId":"ZtvSKoeSRaHTNJPiekx0","featured":true,"updatedAt":"2024-09-30T07:40:30.976Z","published":true,"questionId":"XYz14vu5PO1jjDCB6ddm"},{"createdAt":"2024-09-04T13:20:42.610Z","shopId":"pFjHphiT9hlE94A2WnJk","categoryId":"g9dBEXvSIQokV4ysLfsN","featured":true,"answer":"<p style=\"font-family: Inter;\">High energy efficiency design involves increased components in the heat exchange area due to which input costs increase. Hence, a higher star AC, such as a 5 star AC, costs more than a 2 star one.</p><p style=\"font-family: Inter;\"><br></p><p style=\"font-family: Inter;\">To make an informed choice related to energy and monetary benefits in an AC, one needs to calculate the energy and corresponding monetary savings. Payback period in years = incremental higher price/energy saving in a year over a lower star AC.</p><p style=\"font-family: Inter;\"><br></p><p style=\"font-family: Inter;\">Buying a 5 Star AC is a good decision in the long term, especially given the fact that consumers nowadays use their air conditioners for much longer periods and the power tariff is likely to increase over the years.</p>","question":"Why does a higher star AC cost more? How to calculate the payback period?","updatedAt":"2024-09-26T09:28:59.204Z","published":true,"questionId":"delMswf3WLTQBrierRYR"},{"createdAt":"2024-09-04T13:21:14.076Z","featured":true,"shopId":"pFjHphiT9hlE94A2WnJk","categoryId":"g9dBEXvSIQokV4ysLfsN","answer":"<p style=\"font-family: Inter;\">The star rating of an air conditioner is an indicator of its energy efficiency and is certified by the Bureau of Energy Efficiency (BEE). The star rating aims to help buyers understand the energy efficiency of an Air Conditioner. More the stars, the higher the energy savings and lower the energy bills for the user. As an air conditioner buyer, you can see a Star Label with the ISEER (Indian Seasonal Energy Efficient Ratio) rating standards affixed on the air conditioner. These vary from 1 star to 5 stars, with 1 star being the lowest and 5 stars being the highest in terms of energy efficiency. Blue Star air conditioners are stringently tested and qualify for the BEE energy rating standards.</p>","question":"How does the star rating system help consumers choose an energy-efficient air conditioner?","updatedAt":"2024-09-26T09:29:46.442Z","published":true,"questionId":"dip9eOgVmr2nlxSz6EJ2"},{"createdAt":"2024-09-30T07:37:10.511Z","answer":"<p style=\"font-family: Inter;\">A heavy duty AC is an AC that is designed to withstand harsh conditions and provide reliable cooling. These ACs are typically used in residential, commercial and industrial applications, where they are exposed to dust, dirt, and extreme temperatures.</p>","question":"What is a Heavy Duty AC?","shopId":"pFjHphiT9hlE94A2WnJk","categoryId":"ZtvSKoeSRaHTNJPiekx0","featured":true,"updatedAt":"2024-09-30T07:40:41.203Z","published":true,"questionId":"ep7xC41b3BHX4EnSTHmw"},{"createdAt":"2024-09-30T07:36:49.573Z","answer":"<p style=\"font-family: Inter;\">Smart Enabled ACs come pre-equipped with a Wi-Fi PCB which makes your AC Smart at no extra cost.</p><p style=\"font-family: Inter;\"><br></p><p style=\"font-family: Inter;\">Smart Ready ACs give the consumers an option to convert their normal AC to a WI-FI enabled AC by having a small WI-FI PCB installed at an additional cost. Please get in touch with Blue Star's authorised service center to convert your normal ACs to Smart ACs.</p>","question":"What is the difference between a Smart Enabled AC and Smart Ready AC?","shopId":"pFjHphiT9hlE94A2WnJk","categoryId":"ZtvSKoeSRaHTNJPiekx0","featured":true,"updatedAt":"2024-09-30T07:40:39.564Z","published":true,"questionId":"kJ67YYRIWFePR5gooFwA"},{"createdAt":"2024-09-04T13:01:39.188Z","question":"Should one buy a Split AC or a Window AC?","shopId":"pFjHphiT9hlE94A2WnJk","categoryId":"g9dBEXvSIQokV4ysLfsN","featured":true,"answer":"<p style=\"font-family: Inter;\">A room air conditioner is ideal for rooms up to 200sq. ft. where one of the walls is exposed to the outside. In case of budget and space constraints, one could go for a Window AC.</p><p style=\"font-family: Inter;\"><br></p><p style=\"font-family: Inter;\">Though window units are cheaper and easy to install, Split ACs are quieter in operation, more aesthetically appealing and have better air distribution. If there are no exposed walls, a Split AC is the only option. Split ACs have two units - a compressor unit outside and an indoor unit inside. Since the compressor is kept outside, noise levels are lower in a split air conditioner as compared to the window air conditioner. However, installing the split units may require some renovation work, which implies a monetary investment.</p>","updatedAt":"2024-09-26T09:21:24.885Z","published":true,"questionId":"tqfyCraX4cp9QWiAyHMP"}] || [],
        categories: [{"createdAt":"2024-09-04T13:00:42.342Z","icon":"cart","published":true,"position":3,"shopId":"pFjHphiT9hlE94A2WnJk","categoryId":"g9dBEXvSIQokV4ysLfsN","featured":true,"question":"Frequently Asked Questions","questions":[{"featured":true,"view":12,"questionId":"tqfyCraX4cp9QWiAyHMP","published":true,"title":"Should one buy a Split AC or a Window AC?"},{"featured":true,"view":4,"questionId":"U8D9IJnc7JPllIL9Felo","published":true,"title":"What are some useful points to keep in mind while purchasing an AC?"},{"featured":true,"view":3,"questionId":"GyA1yFyzPxSxCUavONJ8","published":true,"title":"What does one pay for AC installation?"},{"featured":true,"view":4,"questionId":"DqojTSzFr2r3DI8hRgzv","published":true,"title":"How can someone register their product warranty online?"},{"featured":false,"view":4,"questionId":"TOVwAYVaBrvWBnInEDk6","published":true,"title":"What is the order cancellation policy?"},{"featured":true,"view":3,"questionId":"OBAzqOLOI4tdBKHRAX1O","published":true,"title":"What is the right AC tonnage for my room?"},{"featured":true,"view":1,"questionId":"delMswf3WLTQBrierRYR","published":true,"title":"Why does a higher star AC cost more? How to calculate the payback period?"},{"featured":true,"questionId":"dip9eOgVmr2nlxSz6EJ2","published":true,"title":"How does the star rating system help consumers choose an energy-efficient air conditioner?"},{"featured":true,"view":1,"questionId":"DDkwfxwWKrfVeqf9XbGs","published":true,"title":"How does one know if the AC being considered is energy efficient?"},{"featured":true,"view":2,"questionId":"MY7V7WxPHvealwjQNZf9","published":true,"title":"How often should the filters be cleaned?"}],"updatedAt":"2024-10-10T11:28:46.192Z"},{"createdAt":"2024-09-30T07:33:31.019Z","published":true,"position":4,"shopId":"pFjHphiT9hlE94A2WnJk","categoryId":"ZtvSKoeSRaHTNJPiekx0","featured":true,"questions":[{"featured":true,"view":1,"questionId":"RoDAj2TF4ioI183YeSGC","published":true,"title":"What is an 